id: second-wind
name: Second Wind
talentCategory: surge
prerequisites: Personality Score of 4+
description: >
  You are able to recover your stamina more quickly than most.
text: >
  Second Wind: You are able to recover your stamina more quickly than most.
  –Prerequisites: Personality Score of 4+
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Surgency by 1(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: You may use the Surge Maneuver an additional time per Combat Encounter.

---

[passive]
# (1)
surgency += 1(T);
# (2) As Energizing Training's.
surge.uses += 1;
